# FORMOS environment contract (Phase 0)
# Copy to .env for local development. NEVER commit real secrets.
# Classification: [public] safe for browser bundles (NEXT_PUBLIC_* only in apps/web)
#                 [server] server-only, non-secret
#                 [secret] server-only secret — must never enter a browser bundle or log

# --- Public (browser-safe) ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=[public] e.g. https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=[public] Supabase anon key (RLS-protected, safe to expose)

# --- Server-only ---
SUPABASE_URL=[server] server-side project URL (may equal public URL)
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=[server] use anon key server-side wherever RLS suffices
DATABASE_URL=[server] direct Postgres connection (migrations, workers only)
APP_ENV=[server] local | preview | production
APP_URL=[server] canonical app origin, e.g. http://localhost:3000
CRON_SECRET=[secret] bearer for /api/internal/* tick routes (generate: openssl rand -hex 32)
INTAKE_DB_ROLE_PASSWORD=[secret] password for least-privilege intake_caller role (Phase 6+; unused in Phase 0)

# --- Secrets (Phase 0: placeholders only, no live values) ---
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=[secret] NEVER in browser code, workers/deploy only (unused in Phase 0)
BILLING_PROVIDER_SECRET=[secret] V1+ (dead interface in MVP)
